  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The magic of the Feywild guards your mind. You have Advantage on saving throws to avoid or end the Charmed or Frightened condition.</p><p>In addition, whenever you or a creature you can see within 120 feet of you succeeds on a saving throw to avoid or end the Charmed or Frightened condition, you can take a Reaction to force a different creature you can see within 120 feet of yourself to make a Wisdom save against your spell save DC. On a failed save, the target is &amp;Reference[Charmed] or &amp;Reference[Frightened] (your choice) for 1 minute. The target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p>",
